TEXT 400 48 Left 2 ;BIDIRECTIONAL GRID-SIDE AC/DC: 230 Vrms 50 Hz <-> 700 VDC (6.6 kW target)
TEXT 400 80 Left 2 ;FULL-BRIDGE ACTIVE RECTIFIER / GRID-TIED INVERTER WITH AN AC FILTER INDUCTOR
TEXT 400 112 Left 2 ;Grid: VGRID sine source + LGRID 2.2mH. DC bus: VBUS 700V ideal source/sink + CDC 1000uF.
TEXT 400 1040 Left 2 ;MODE 0 = G2V: grid supplies DC bus. MODE 1 = V2G: DC bus supplies AC grid.
TEXT 400 1072 Left 2 ;GRID CURRENT sign: I(LGRID) > 0 exports AC energy (V2G), < 0 imports (G2V).
TEXT 400 1104 Left 2 ;VBUS holds the link at 700V for separate AC/DC testing; replace with shared bus when integrated.
TEXT 400 1136 Left 2 ;PWM carrier and behavioral current-controller signals (bottom): TRI, IREF, MOD, GHI, GLO, ISNS (1us-filtered current sense).
TEXT 400 1344 Left 2 !.param MODE=1 LAC=2.2m RFF=0.20 KP=30 FGRID=50 VRMS=230 PSET=6600 FSW=50k
TEXT 400 1376 Left 2 !.model SWPWR SW(Ron=0.04 Roff=1Meg Vt=2.5 Vh=0.1)
TEXT 400 1408 Left 2 !.model DFAST D(Is=1n Rs=0.02 N=1.2 BV=1200 Cjo=200p Tt=0)
TEXT 400 1440 Left 2 !.tran 0 80m 0 100n uic
TEXT 1200 1440 Left 2 !.options method=gear
TEXT 400 1472 Left 2 !.meas tran GRID_VRMS RMS V(GRID,NEUTRAL) FROM 60m TO 80m
TEXT 400 1504 Left 2 !.meas tran GRID_IRMS RMS I(LGRID) FROM 60m TO 80m
TEXT 400 1536 Left 2 !.meas tran GRID_P_AVG AVG (V(GRID,NEUTRAL)*I(LGRID)) FROM 60m TO 80m
TEXT 400 1568 Left 2 !.meas tran BUS_P_AVG AVG (V(BUS)*I(VBUS)) FROM 60m TO 80m
TEXT 400 1600 Left 2 !.meas tran I_GRID_AVG AVG I(LGRID) FROM 60m TO 80m
TEXT 400 1632 Left 2 ;G2V expected: GRID_P_AVG negative, BUS_P_AVG positive. V2G is reverse.
TEXT 400 1664 Left 2 ;Startup fix: UIC bypasses DC operating point; LGRID starts at zero current; CDC starts at 700V (IC) so it does not fight VBUS at t=0.
TEXT 400 1696 Left 2 ;Plot V(GRID,NEUTRAL), NOT V(NEUTRAL); grid voltage is differential.
TEXT 400 1728 Left 2 ;Check I(LGRID) should settle to about 29 Arms, not kiloamps; use Ctrl+L for power measurements.
TEXT 400 1760 Left 2 ;Step6 convergence fixes: 200p diode Cjo on switch nodes, smooth tanh gate edges, 1us current-sense filter, Roff 1Meg, Gear integration.
TEXT 400 1792 Left 2 ;Sanity check: V(AC_A,NEUTRAL) should chop between +700V and -700V. If it never switches, swap the 0/GHI and 0/GLO flags on the switch control pins.
